{"id":3644,"name":"Koroshi Ai","slug":"koroshi_ai","synopsis":"Two assassins face off. The cool bounty hunter Chateau and the mysterious and powerful Ryang-ha. Chateau and Ryang-ha become enemies after this fight—at least, they should have, but for some reason Ryang-ha takes a liking to Chateau and begins following her around.\n\nLittle by little, Chateau develops a cooperative partnership with Ryang-ha, which gets her caught up in the struggle against the organizations hunting him down. Furthermore, that battle is related to her past as well. Two mismatched assassins weave together a twisted \"Assassin X Assassin\" thriller. The strange gears of fate begin to move.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)\n\n\n*Note: The first episode had an early premiere at AnimeNYC 2021.*","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2022,"createdAt":"2022-01-13 08:09:07","updatedAt":"2022-01-13 09:05:56","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":44516},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":127050},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":15917},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":44226},{"site":"ANN","externalId":24514},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":16083},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":8225,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/zWslfmd3j30uYrJJXvGFfITGfdCsNv68jNsrbzsx.png"},{"id":8226,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/I158TJDSeAmyQEiSrYwdoRcLS9Onveq62Gyuh0bN.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":159,"name":"Platinum Vision","slug":"platinum_vision"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":11103,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":11108,"title":"Midnight Dancer","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":12925,"version":1,"episodes":"1-10","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":14982,"basename":"KoroshiAi-OP1.webm","filename":"KoroshiAi-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/KoroshiAi-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":34330634,"resolu